<div style="text-align: center;">
<blockquote>
<p><em><strong>Away with such a God! Better to have no God, better to set up destiny on one’s own account, better to be a fool, better to be God oneself!</strong></em></p>
<div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div>
</blockquote>
</div>
<p>God's dead. But why?</p>
<p>First of all, huge thanks to Philip Ob Rey for allowing me to use one his works for my 5kon image. Check out his website here. <a href="http://www.humantropy.com/">http://www.humantropy.com/</a></p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
