</div>
<p>Thank you to everyone who critted this, like lt flops, akimoto and cimmerian, among countless others I'm probably forgetting. Special thanks to RTME and Kinchtheknifeblade for inspiring parts of this.</p>
<p>While you're here, <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/cerastes-informational-file">why not check out my other stuff?</a></p>
<p>Numbers desired: 5003, 5004, 5998, somewhere else between 5001-5010 if available, 5343</p>
