			<div class="content" id="post-content-4470845">
									

<p>It's gonna be a no-vote from me, and here's why -</p>
<p>I don't know if it's because I myself am intensely religious, but I love this concept. I love it so much, and this line just made me love it even more -</p>
<blockquote>
<p>It feels beautiful&#8230; dying in the dark. You're living in the light. I did my duty.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>So many stories and ideas came to mind when I read this line. This is beautiful, and heartbreaking. It deserves to be expanded, dramatically so. It deserves expansion on the scale of Rituals, or the Montauk House. This idea, I think, is strong enough to be nurtured, and grown, and developed into the best article on the website. To keep it this short would be a shame.</p>
<p>Please, please, please keep working on this. There's so much more here, so much potential. Give it the time it needs to grow. And thank you for writing it.</p>

